Model: LinearSVC + TF-IDF (1–2 grams)
Calibration: sigmoid (cv=2/3 depending on class counts)

Evaluation:
- 5-fold Stratified CV
- Holdout test (20%)

Metrics:
- Macro F1 (primary)
- Confusion matrix
- Per-class precision/recall

Safety Layer:
- Emergency keyword override
- Low-confidence fallback planned

Random Seed: 42

